          ─── THE WAY OUT, AND WHY IT IS ALWAYS PRESENT ────────────────────

          Reported from production: a reader on /feed met a Google sign-in
          modal inside the player, signed in, and the iframe still refused to
          play. They were stuck with nothing to click but Close.

          That is not a bug in this site's markup. There is no `sandbox`
