          would trade the privacy posture away and STILL not play an
          age-restricted video. What the reader actually lacked was a door.

          This link is rendered ALWAYS and its href is set every time the
          modal opens, so the escape hatch does not depend on detecting the
          failure. The note above it is the enhancement: it appears only when
          the player tells us it refused, which explains WHY rather than
          leaving a working-looking player that does nothing.
        */}
